      "body": "LGTM.\n\nTested at 3e858235cc. The llama3_json, internlm2, granite_20b_fc and apertus parser tests pass here. I swapped the old and new function into `Llama3JsonToolParser` and streamed a `write_file` call 4 chars per delta at your sizes, and the streamed arguments match. My speedup was smaller, 1.65x at 4 KB down to 1.42x at 32 KB. I think that comes down to differences in our environments, so it looks fine to me.\n",
